        "content": "**Targets:** ingest internal errors \u003c= 0.1% · enrichment success under 5s \u003e= 95% · outbox terminal failures \u003c= 0.1% · OIDC login failures \u003c= 0.1% · API key denials stay explainable\n\n**Flow:** burn trend -\u003e tenant impact -\u003e source / result attribution -\u003e auth, MCP, GDPR, and delivery drilldowns.\n\n**Thresholds:** fast burn \u003e 14.4x · slow burn \u003e 6.0x.",
